# Testing conventions

## Backend

- JUnit 5, Mockito, Spring Boot Test, Testcontainers (PostgreSQL)
- Do not use H2 as a substitute for PostgreSQL integration tests
- Integration tests should extend `support.IntegrationTestBase` when a database is required
- Run: `cd backend && ./gradlew test`

## Frontend

- Playwright for end-to-end smoke and flow tests
- Configure tests against the Next.js dev server via `playwright.config.ts`
- Run: `cd frontend && npm run test:e2e`

## Expectations for agents

- Add or update tests when changing behavior that is already covered
- Keep smoke tests minimal until features exist
- Do not skip failing tests; fix root causes or document environment prerequisites (e.g. Docker for Testcontainers)
